simulation S { duration 1 h }
intersection A at (0 m, 0 m)
intersection B at 100 m east of A
intersection C at 100 m east of B
road AB from A to B
road BC from B to C
route R = A -> B -> C
flow F along R { spawn 1 every 8 s }
metric Llegadas = count() on arrival label "Vehículos que llegaron"
metric ViajeTotal = sum(trip.travel_time) on arrival label "Tiempo de viaje total"
metric ViajePromedio = average(trip.travel_time) on arrival label "Tiempo de viaje promedio"
metric ColaMínima = minimum(queue(AB)) on tick label "Cola mínima en AB"
metric OcupaciónMáxima = maximum(occupancy(BC)) on tick label "Ocupación máxima de BC"
